<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Container on 瘦了就帅了</title><link>https://blog.cuile.com/tags/container/</link><description>Recent content in Container on 瘦了就帅了</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:45:37 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.cuile.com/tags/container/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Podman的安装</title><link>https://blog.cuile.com/post/container/podman/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 18:49:39 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.cuile.com/post/container/podman/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="1-在lxc容器下安装">1. 在LXC容器下安装&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="修改特权容器">修改特权容器&lt;/h3>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>LXC容器必须是特权容器，但创建CT时，默认为非特权容器，要特别注意！！！&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">nano /etc/pve/lxc/&amp;lt;CTID&amp;gt;.conf
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>删除或注释掉 unprivileged: 1 这一行。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>确保没有 lxc.idmap 相关的UID/GID映射配置（如有则删除）。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Web UI -&amp;gt; LXC 容器 -&amp;gt; 选项 (Options) -&amp;gt; 功能 (Features) -&amp;gt; 编辑 (Edit)
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>勾选 FUSE&lt;/li>
&lt;li>勾选 嵌套&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="2-安装">2. 安装&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="debian">Debian&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">apt update &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> apt install -y curl gpg gnupg2
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 查看 Debian版本&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">apt install -y lsb-release &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> lsb_release -a
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># if Debian Release == 13&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 添加 Kubic 项目的 Debian_Testing 软件源&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;deb http://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:/kubic:/libcontainers:/stable/Debian_Testing/ /&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/kubic.list
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 下载并添加对应的 GPG 密钥&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">curl -fsSL https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/devel:kubic:libcontainers:stable/Debian_Testing/Release.key &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> gpg --dearmor &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> sudo tee /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/kubic.gpg &amp;gt; /dev/null
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 更新软件包列表并安装 Podman&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">apt update &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> apt install -y podman &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> podman version 
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 安装 podman-compose&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">apt install -y pipx &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> pipx ensurepath &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> . ~/.bashrc &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> pipx install podman-compose &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> podman-compose version
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> 
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># iptables必须安装，否则netavark无法运行&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">apt install -y iptables 
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 防火墙一定要加这条，否则容器之间的名称解析无法工作&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">iptables -A INPUT -p udp -m udp --dport &lt;span class="m">53&lt;/span> -j ACCEPT
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="almalinux">AlmaLinux&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">dnf install -y podman python3 python3-pip &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> podman --version &lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> podman info &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> python3 -m pip install --upgrade pip &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> python3 -m pip install podman-compose &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> podman-compose -v &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> systemctl &lt;span class="nb">enable&lt;/span> podman-restart.service &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> systemctl start podman-restart.service
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="3-加速">3. 加速&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>国内镜像源与代理二选一，但考虑到未来的日常使用，还是换源简单一些。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>docker | podman 命令</title><link>https://blog.cuile.com/post/container/cli/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Jan 2022 22:20:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.cuile.com/post/container/cli/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="image-列表">Image 列表&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> image ls -a
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># or&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> images
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="container-列表">Container 列表&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> container ls -a
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># or&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> ps
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="查看输出">查看输出&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> compose -f &amp;lt;yaml_file&amp;gt; logs &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>-f&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>service name&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># or&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> logs &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>-f&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>container id&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="验证配置文件">验证配置文件&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> compose -f &amp;lt;yaml_file&amp;gt; config
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="删除冗余-image">删除冗余 Image&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;y&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> system prune
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="导入导出-image">导入/导出 Image&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 导出&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> save -o &amp;lt;image&amp;gt;.tar &amp;lt;image_name:label &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> image_id&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 导入&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 使用image_id导出的Image ，导入时也没有名字&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> load -i &amp;lt;image&amp;gt;.tar
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="导入导出-volume">导入/导出 Volume&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 导出数据&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">podman volume &lt;span class="nb">export&lt;/span> &amp;lt;volume_name&amp;gt; &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> gzip &amp;gt; /tmp/&amp;lt;volume_name&amp;gt;_backup.tar.gz
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">scp /tmp/&amp;lt;volume_name&amp;gt;_backup.tar user@hostname:/tmp/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 或使用 rsync&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">rsync -avz /tmp/&amp;lt;volume_name&amp;gt;_backup.tar user@hostname:/tmp/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 创建目标卷&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">podman volume create &amp;lt;volume_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 导入数据&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">gunzip -c /tmp/&amp;lt;volume_name&amp;gt;_backup.tar.gz &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman volume import &amp;lt;volume_name&amp;gt; -
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="不启动-image-查看-image-内的文件">不启动 Image ，查看 Image 内的文件&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 创建临时容器&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> conatiner create --name &amp;lt;container_name&amp;gt; &amp;lt;image_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 从容器复制文件到宿主机&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> conatiner cp &amp;lt;container_name&amp;gt;:&amp;lt;file_path&amp;gt; &amp;lt;dest_path&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 清理临时窗口&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> container rm &amp;lt;container_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="创建桥接网络">创建桥接网络&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>docker &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> podman&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span> network create &lt;span class="o">[&lt;/span>name&lt;span class="o">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="docker--podman快捷命令">[docker | podman]快捷命令&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;alias d-ll=&amp;#39;[docker | podman] image ls -a; echo; [docker | podman] container ls -a&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;alias d-ps=&amp;#39;[docker | podman] ps&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;alias d-clean=&amp;#39;[docker | podman] system prune -f&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;alias d-rm=&amp;#39;_a(){ [docker | podman] image rm &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">$1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">; echo; [docker | podman] container rm &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">$1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">; }; _a&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;alias d-exec=&amp;#39;_a(){ [docker | podman] exec -it &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">$1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2"> /bin/bash; }; _a&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;alias d-stop=&amp;#39;_a(){ [docker | podman] container stop &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">$1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">; }; _a&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;alias d-kill=&amp;#39;_a(){ [docker | podman] container kill &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nv">$1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">; }; _a&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; ~/.bashrc
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> 
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">source&lt;/span> ~/.bashrc
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div></description></item></channel></rss>